pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  [Sources]
  - Project goal and harvest-cycle scope: linkagent/preview.md
  - Harvest lifecycle boundary: linkagent/docs/harvest_cycle/ATOMIC_SKILLS_ROADMAP.md
  [/Sources]
elements:
  - elementId: p2-top-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 22, 848, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: p2-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 38, 420, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: "01  /  THE PROBLEM  ·  问题"
      wrap: false
  - elementId: p2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 64, 830, 48]
    content:
      style: "$slideTitle"
      text: "Tactile intelligence / 触觉驱动的无损采摘"
      wrap: false
  - elementId: p2-statement
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 150, 408, 210]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>Tomatoes are compliant, variable, and easily damaged.</strong></p>
        <p>番茄柔软、个体差异大，并且容易受到损伤。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:14px"><strong>A robot must balance secure grasping, low pressure, and reliable detachment.</strong></p>
        <p>机器人必须同时平衡稳定抓取、低接触压力和可靠摘取。</p>
      align: [left, top]
